92d446e50b7a5900af7d50d027bf67fe  /tmp/nginx.conf   = config/nginx.conf ✅ 일치

## 5-③ 설치 → 검사 → 실행 (서버 터미널)
### 1차 시도 (서버 터미널, 사용자 출력 원문)
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo install -m 644 /tmp/index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo install -m 644 /tmp/nginx.conf /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo nginx -t
nginx: [warn] could not build optimal types_hash, you should increase either types_hash_max_size: 1024 or types_hash_bucket_size: 64; ignoring types_hash_bucket_size
nginx: the configuration file /etc/nginx/nginx.conf syntax is ok
nginx: configuration file /etc/nginx/nginx.conf test is successful
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ systemctl is-active nginx
inactive
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo systemctl reload nginx
nginx.service is not active, cannot reload.
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ scp -i ~/.ssh/b3-1-ed25519 config/nginx.conf ec2-user@13.124.137.81:/tmp/
scp: stat local "config/nginx.conf": No such file or directory      ← 서버 터미널에서 실행한 실수 (파일은 Mac에만 있음)
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ exit

### 조치: config/nginx.conf 에 `types_hash_max_size 4096;` 추가 후 재전송 (Mac)
ellysuh@ellysuhui-MacBookAir-2 B3-1 % scp -i ~/.ssh/b3-1-ed25519 config/nginx.conf ec2-user@13.124.137.81:/tmp/
nginx.conf                                    100% 1251   143.3KB/s   00:00

### 2차 시도 (서버 터미널, 사용자 출력 원문)
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo install -m 644 /tmp/nginx.conf /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo nginx -t
nginx: the configuration file /etc/nginx/nginx.conf syntax is ok
nginx: configuration file /etc/nginx/nginx.conf test is successful
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ sudo systemctl enable --now nginx
Created symlink /etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/nginx.service → /usr/lib/systemd/system/nginx.service.
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ systemctl is-active nginx
active
[ec2-user@ip-10-0-1-122 ~]$ curl -i http://localhost/health
